constraints:
1 <= Number of nodes <= 10^{5}
1 <= Value of nodes<= 10^{5}

expected time complexity: O(Height of the BST)
expected auxiliary space: O(Height of the BST).

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def findCeil(self, root, x):
		ceil = -1
		while root:
			if root.key == x:
				return x
			if root.key < x:
				root = root.right
			elif root.key > x:
				ceil = root.key
				root = root.left
		return ceil
